### Send a support request (mailed to tafeladmin.support.recipients, 500 when none is configured)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/support
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Login geht nicht",
  "text": "Nach dem Anmelden bleibt die Seite leer.",
  "clientContext": {
    "screenshot": "data:image/jpeg;base64,/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQAAAQABAAD/2wBDAP//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////wgALCAABAAEBAREA/8QAFBABAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAP/aAAgBAQABPxA=",
    "page": "http://localhost:4200/uebersicht",
    "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0 Chrome/128",
    "viewport": "1280x800",
    "screen": "1920x1080",
    "language": "de-AT",
    "timeZone": "Europe/Vienna",
    "recentErrors": [
      {
        "timestamp": "10:15:00",
        "message": "HTTP 500 - GET /api/households"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### The whole clientContext is optional - a request without it still goes out
POST {{baseApiPath}}/support
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Verbesserungsvorschlag",
  "text": "Die Kundensuche könnte den Fokus behalten."
}
